add(803,'self-flagged step',[191,192],'48–103','cf plus bas; mettre en lemme; r n’est pas exact à g.','A realization from a stack of multigaloisian categories preserves finite sums and admissible quotients; R2 compares summands with clopens, R3 gives effective descent for covering summands, and R4 covers by rank pieces. Pullback preservation is claimed only along monomorphisms.','Right exactness is not left exactness. We reconstruct the pullback lemma using complements and finite coproducts.','agrees','The author explicitly warns against treating r as left exact; the forward reference and lemma request are real.')
