add(818,'self-flagged step',[203,204],'2–60','crible admissible; α pleinement fidèle ?','For admissible sieves C_0, the comparison α goes from subordinate objects to a limit of categories of covers over s(M). Local filteredness allows a filtered union; all φ(M)→1 are temporarily assumed epimorphic.','Full faithfulness of φ is an additional proposed sufficient condition. Whether admissibility is recoverable from (C,s) is expressly left as a condition.','agrees','The source does not assert reconstruction from an arbitrary functor without generation, filteredness and descent.')
