add(822,'self-flagged step',[209,210,211,212],'125–197','Il resterait à prouver (ii)⇒(iii); majorant le rang','The product-of-Galois-categories characterization is connected to G0–G5; the proof reduces to connected objects and proposes an induction on a rank bound.','G5 does not specify whether the summand is in C/Y′. Countable sets refute the intended slice interpretation but fail the unsliced literal version by Hilbert hotel. The reduction from arbitrary objects to connected ones is not justified by G4 alone.','agrees','This conditional distinction was independently checked by peer review_31. It is not an unqualified refutation of every reading of G5.')
